        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">We recently updated keys for features that accepted trusted HTML to use <code class=\"notranslate\">enforces_trusted_types</code> with a clear statement of the requirement. This mirrors the behaviour for the other existing BCD entries that take TrustedScript and TrustedScriptURL.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">FYI <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/lukewarlow/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/lukewarlow\">@lukewarlow</a></p>",
